abstract: "Three independently deployable lanes of a layered AI-safety architecture: Watermark studies OpenAI's textGrain watermark with a hardened detector, retrieval, signed registry and 13-attack harness; safety holds the early-warning observers (Layer 3); hardware is the silicon root of trust, attestation verifier, default-deny control plane, tamper-evident audit trail and NVIDIA Open Agent Safety Platform adapter, with a 66-attack harness. Software is licensed under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0; documentation, data and figures under CC BY-NC 4.0. Attribution is required; commercial use requires a separate license (see LICENSING.md)."
